[00:12.69]Producer：Lightning_W
[00:18.12]In the stillness of the night
{"在夜的静谧中"}
[00:22.73]A gentle melody takes flight
{"轻柔旋律悄然升起"}
[00:26.85]Soft notes floating through the air
{"音符在空气中轻盈飘荡"}
[00:30.62]Guiding me to you my dear
{"指引我走向你 亲爱的"}
[00:36.91]You are the light that shines so bright
